_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2863181937","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105327#issuecomment-2863181937","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105327","id":2863181937,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6qqLBx","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-08T14:00:39Z","updated_at":"2025-05-08T14:00:39Z","body":"CC @anvilfolk @Hilderin @dalexeev ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2863181937/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2864872740","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105327#issuecomment-2864872740","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105327","id":2864872740,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6qwn0k","user":{"login":"anvilfolk","id":1133892,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzM4OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1133892?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anvilfolk","html_url":"https://github.com/anvilfolk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anvilfolk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anvilfolk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anvilfolk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anvilfolk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anvilfolk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anvilfolk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anvilfolk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anvilfolk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anvilfolk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-09T01:57:50Z","updated_at":"2025-05-09T01:58:42Z","body":"Is the crash from running the project or from the exporting process? Assuming the latter for now.\n\nSafe to say it looks like some threading issue resulting in problems. Any chance we can get more information about which threads / what functions those threads are running when the errors are thrown?\n\nAt this point without further information it can be any number of things:\n1) Some new process is attempting to regenerate the cache, thus force-loading all .gd files, while GDScript is already executing somewhere. Does exporting create a new process or use the current editor process?\n2) Attempting to close the an \"editor\" process before before the cache generating thread finishes.\n3) The load task errors I reported in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/95821 may finally be affecting something. The loading thread is iterating over every  .gd file in `EditorFileSystem`, calling `ResourceLoader::load()` on it and waiting for the result before moving on to the next file. If the `ResourceLoader` is adding dependent .gd files to be loaded in parallel, that could be at the core of the issue. @RandomShaper had some thoughts / questions about this in that PR.\n\nCan we rule any of these out? I feel like 2) is unlikely if exporting doesn't launch a new process, so I'm leaning towards 3).\n\nI'm going to work on a PR to add a project setting to enable/disable script doc caching. It should at least provide a workaround.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2864872740/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2866442992","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105327#issuecomment-2866442992","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105327","id":2866442992,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6q2nLw","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-09T12:55:37Z","updated_at":"2025-05-09T12:55:37Z","body":"I forgot to mention that I'm exporting from command line (with `--export-debug`/`--export-release`)\n\nI think the \"workaround\" is just disabling doc generation when the editor runs in export mode.\nWe should improve the command line options, the editor performs many extra tasks for no reason (like #101765) :/\n\n> Some new process is attempting to regenerate the cache, thus force-loading all .gd files, while GDScript is already executing somewhere. Does exporting create a new process or use the current editor process?\n\nI'm exporting from command line, so it creates a new process, while I have already another editor window open. I don't see how they could interfere though.\n\nI also don't get why doc generation would run in this case, unless it happens every time even if the script was not changed? I did a test and had a successful export without crash, but then saved a random script in the editor and it's crashing again.\n\n> Attempting to close the an \"editor\" process before before the cache generating thread finishes.\n\nThat might be happening, according to my stack trace. The DEV_ASSERT is hit during cleanup, in a non-main thread.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2866442992/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]